<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - 页面未找到</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 1em;
            color: #fff;
            background-color: #007bff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>页面未找到</h1>
        <p>抱歉，您请求的页面无法找到。可能是链接错误，或者页面已经被删除。</p>
      
    </div>
</body>
</html>